# Agrus Kos, "Whenever Agrus Kos enters or attacks, choose up to one target creature. If it's suspected, exile it. Otherwise, suspect it." Turn 1: Agrus Kos enters and Bot1 chooses no target (up to one): nothing happens.
# Turn 3: it attacks (double strike, vigilance: 2 damage twice, and it stays untapped) and its trigger suspects Bot2's Memnite (menace, can't block). Turn 5: it attacks again, Memnite is already suspected, so it is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice.Suspected = (absent)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Suspected = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = CantBlock; Menace
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 16
? Bot1.Battlefield.Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice.Tapped = false
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Memnite
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 12
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Exile = Memnite
